# *u² on a Knill C4 block = inverse cyclic relabeling 1 → 3 → 2 → 1.
# The gadget's output support carries the permutation instead of physical
# SWAPs, whose correlated two-qubit faults can cause undetected logical errors.
#
# Action on Knill C4 logicals (multiplication by u²):
#   X_L → X_L X_S
#   X_S → X_L
#   Z_L → Z_S
#   Z_S → Z_L Z_S

I 0 1 2 3
